  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Cloud Computing Data Center, through Government of Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $402,675 partially funds a feasibility study to define the market opportunity, strategy, size, scope, implementation plan, and tender process for a Cloud Computing Data Center to be constructed in Ho Cho Minh City, Vietnam. The project provides information technology applications, database, and server resources to Vi Na Group Corporation (VNG) clients and potentially new customers. The study also identifies how the project could be constructed to meet energy efficiency LEED Certified standards and provides the procurement documents required for VNG to acquire all project components. VNG has identified Pathway Systems LLC (PWS) on a sole-source basis, who has agreed to provide a cost share and sign a success fee agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
